• First Four: a new beginner mode for brand-new operators. Enter your call and state, and it teaches your call, your state, ? and 73 by ear and by key, then walks you through busted calls, unanswered calls and a whole POTA contact. Find it under Start here.
• Wider layout when the window is wide, as on the iPad.
• USB MIDI keys and the Vail Adapter work as on the iPhone. A Bluetooth MIDI key is paired in Audio MIDI Setup (Window › Show MIDI Studio › Bluetooth); the app's Bluetooth key button shows the steps.
Please try: First Four with the keyboard or a Vail Adapter, resizing the window, and Listen & Learn in the background. Tell us about anything that looks wrong or sounds wrong.
